/*
 * ACT VII — OPERATE · artifact templates and knowledge entries the act uses that the
 * shared libraries (artifacts.js, knowledge.js) lack. Loaded before acts/operate-units.js.
 *
 * Shapes are exactly those of artifacts.js and knowledge.js. Inputs that arrive from
 * earlier acts carry an "ops-" id so they never overwrite the upstream act's own template.
 *
 * Running example: the auto-fill service that reads emailed PDF orders into the ERP
 * (DEC-012, INI-004), released site by site. Live at Site 1 on 8 Sep 2025 and Site 2 on
 * 22 Sep. Its SLOs: SLO-01 imports succeed 99.5% · SLO-02 95% of orders drafted within
 * 5 minutes · SLO-03 95% of auto-filled lines need no clerk correction. On 7 Oct a batch
 * of 200-dpi faxed scans is misread (INC-118); the cause becomes PRB-002 with workaround
 * KE-004, and the accuracy budget is spent (EBR-2025-10).
 */
